title: Coordinate the Press
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: public_campaign
view-if: press_coordination_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; press_coordination_timer = 4

= Coordinate the Press

- @press_constitution: Lead with constitutional procedure
- @press_oil: Explain the oil case
- @press_plural: Preserve room for coalition disagreement

@press_constitution
on-arrival: press_capacity += 4; constitutional_legitimacy += 3; public_mandate += 2
go-to: post_event

@press_oil
on-arrival: press_capacity += 4; oil_coalition_support += 4; independent_nationalists_relation += 2
go-to: post_event

@press_plural
on-arrival: press_capacity += 3; toilers_dissent -= 2; religious_network_dissent -= 2; political_intelligence += 2
go-to: post_event
